 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Then enjoy the freedom to use whichever hand feels most comfortable. Lots of people switch their mouse between left and right sides. Yes, especially if you use a trackpad mainly with your right hand. It gives you quick switch without anyone noticing. Yes, the latest MacBook Pros have amazing trackpads, and they' cheap to buy as new desk top accessories. If you find yourself stuck outside, a clip on one is only twenty dollars. Try using the right hand side of a laptop trackpad with your left hand. It' a good exercise.",
